{"n": 361, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "361.webp", "text": "00 2 510\nM002 500\n\n~~ 530 21016)\n\n21-4\n\n2121565 CHECKING DRIVE PLATE FOR\nLATERAL RUNOUT\n— Drive Plate Removed —\n\nClamp Special Tool 21 2 110 in a vise.\nMount Special Tools 00 2510 and 00 2 500.\n\nClamp drive plate on tester and clean liner\nwith emery cloth,\n\nApply dial gage about 3 mm (0,118) from\nouter edge.\nTurn drive plate and read lateral runout*.\n\nStraighten drive plate by applying knocks\nfrom a plastic hammer on take-up points of\ntester.\n\nRepeat testing procedures.\n\n* See Specifications\n\n16 21025\n\n2151000 REMOVING AND INSTALLING/\nREPLACING CLUTCH RELEASE\n\nRemove transmission 23 00 020.\nRemove spring (1) and release lever (2) with\nrelease (3).\n\nfastallation:\n\nPack lubricating groove (N) with Molykote\nLongterm 2.\n\nCoat guides (F) and bearings (L) with\nMolykote Longterm 2.\n\nNon-conformance could cause bearing to seize\non guide sleeve.\n\nCheck specified height B* and C* of release.\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["00", 0.1003, 0.0703, 0.1525, 0.0836], ["2", 0.1196, 0.0617, 0.1266, 0.0895], ["510", 0.1317, 0.0703, 0.1525, 0.0836], ["M002", 0.1023, 0.0862, 0.1631, 0.1194], ["500", 0.1682, 0.0995, 0.1925, 0.1121], ["~~", 0.1667, 0.4987, 0.1839, 0.5013], ["530", 0.1874, 0.498, 0.2036, 0.5053], ["21016)", 0.2072, 0.4973, 0.2366, 0.5106], ["21-4", 0.4585, 0.0239, 0.5086, 0.0471], ["2121565", 0.2604, 0.0617, 0.309, 0.0723], ["CHECKING", 0.3222, 0.0617, 0.3794, 0.0729], ["DRIVE", 0.384, 0.0623, 0.4179, 0.0729], ["PLATE", 0.4225, 0.0623, 0.4569, 0.0729], ["FOR", 0.4615, 0.0623, 0.4833, 0.0729], ["LATERAL", 0.3232, 0.0776, 0.3744, 0.0889], ["RUNOUT", 0.3789, 0.0782, 0.425, 0.0889], ["—", 0.3227, 0.0995, 0.3293, 0.1015], ["Drive", 0.3333, 0.0942, 0.3587, 0.1048], ["Plate", 0.3617, 0.0942, 0.385, 0.1048], ["Removed", 0.3891, 0.0942, 0.4326, 0.1048], ["—", 0.4367, 0.0995, 0.4433, 0.1021], ["Clamp", 0.2599, 0.126, 0.2908, 0.1393], ["Special", 0.2938, 0.126, 0.3273, 0.